  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know that you guys are aware of this issue (Tupper himself said so), but I'm posting this canny so it doesn't get forgotten.\nA fair amount of people, including myself, were excited for this new state behaviour, but sadly it was removed for 2020.3.2. What we don't want is this implementation be forgotten, and plan this redesign and give a small priority in bringing back this state behaviour, if possible.",
